{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pJBPdcb5Jx1795595201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市急挫，AI及半導體板塊受壓。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市再度失守5,000點大關，落到4,697點，收市跌幅逾百分之6。兩大權重股SK海力士和三星電子，下挫約一成至一成一。日本股市跌至57,000邊緣。台灣股市跌近半成，上日升停板的台積電，回吐逾百分之3。澳洲股市回軟，跌幅不足百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.339216+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:35.922819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:37:19.454638+00:00","content_hash":"7329c4f2221edc59410987fd4ded7d428337cec9702f1c888c9e691b6a1f6ca4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:43:55.339216+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}